  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As you know, people can get extremely toxic towards people who've muted them.  Going to the lengths like crashing the person, voting to kick them or abusing the moderation system. \nThis change would still let you mute people but it would only be visible to the one doing the muting. \nI think this would clearly remove one layer of toxicity that some players face. \nAnd on top of it all, it'll just make obnoxious players waste their time because they'll have no idea who's actually muted them or not.",
